-- lg-no-braces-001 (lg-no-braces, difficulty 3)
select pg_temp.upsert_question($q$lg-no-braces-001$q$, $q$prog-1-digi$q$, $q$logic$q$, 3,
  $q$```csharp
int x = 0;
if (x > 5)
    Console.Write("A");
    Console.Write("B");
Console.Write("C");
```
Čo vypíše tento kód?$q$,
  array[$q$`A`$q$, $q$`C`$q$, $q$`ABC`$q$, $q$`BC`$q$], 3, $q$Bez zložených zátvoriek patrí k `if` iba prvý príkaz (`A`). Odsadenie na tom nič nemení – riadok s `B` sa vykoná vždy.$q$,
  $q$```csharp
int x = 0;
if (x > 5)
    Console.Write("A");
    Console.Write("B");
Console.Write("C");
```
What does this code print?$q$,
  array[$q$`A`$q$, $q$`C`$q$, $q$`ABC`$q$, $q$`BC`$q$], $q$Without braces only the first statement (`A`) belongs to the `if`. Indentation doesn't change that – the line with `B` always runs.$q$);

