  array[$q$`A`$q$, $q$Compile error$q$, $q$The program crashes (DivideByZeroException)$q$, $q$`B`$q$], $q$`&&` and `||` short-circuit: the left side already decides the result, so the right side is never evaluated – no division by zero happens.$q$);

